                                "example_id": "db664ddc-8830-455e-9627-10fc04cf298b",
                                "sense_id": "70570469-0ce9-365e-af46-a0d15eab6007",
                                "text": "I set them down here, that their names may be a stink and ill-savour to aftercoming generations, as apostate from the way of God[…]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
